msgid ""
"Fill out the :ref:`credentials <accounting/bank-sync/enablebanking/"
"settings>`. Also check that a connection with its own application id has its "
"own key."
msgstr ""
"Completați :ref:`credențialele <accounting/bank-sync/enablebanking/"
"settings>`. Verificați și că o conexiune cu propriul application id are "
"propria cheie."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:281
msgid "*The Enable Banking private key is not a valid PEM RSA key.*"
msgstr "*The Enable Banking private key is not a valid PEM RSA key.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:282
msgid ""
"Paste the complete content of the key file, from the ``BEGIN`` to the "
"``END`` line, without a password protection."
msgstr ""
"Lipiți conținutul complet al fișierului cheii, de la linia ``BEGIN`` până la "
"linia ``END``, fără protecție prin parolă."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:284
msgid "*Choose the bank first (use 'Load banks' to get the list).*"
msgstr "*Choose the bank first (use 'Load banks' to get the list).*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:285
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Load banks` and select the :guilabel:`Bank`."
msgstr ""
"Faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Încarcă băncile` și selectați :guilabel:`Bancă`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:286
msgid "*The bank did not return an authorization code.*"
msgstr "*The bank did not return an authorization code.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:287
msgid ""
"The consent was cancelled or refused at the bank. Click :guilabel:`Connect "
"to bank` again."
msgstr ""
"Consimțământul a fost anulat sau refuzat la bancă. Faceți clic din nou "
"pe :guilabel:`Connect to bank`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:288
msgid "*The bank authorization took too long. Please start it again.*"
msgstr "*The bank authorization took too long. Please start it again.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:289
msgid ""
"The consent must be completed within an hour. Click :guilabel:`Connect to "
"bank` again."
msgstr ""
"Consimțământul trebuie finalizat în decurs de o oră. Faceți clic din nou "
"pe :guilabel:`Connect to bank`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:290
msgid ""
"*The bank consent is no longer valid (...). Renew the consent on the "
"connection.*"
msgstr ""
"*The bank consent is no longer valid (...). Renew the consent on the "
"connection.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:291
msgid ""
"The session expired or was closed or revoked at the bank. The connection is "
"set to :guilabel:`Expired`: click :guilabel:`Renew consent`."
msgstr ""
"Sesiunea a expirat sau a fost închisă ori revocată la bancă. Conexiunea este "
"setată la :guilabel:`Expirat`: faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Renew consent`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:293
msgid "*The bank consent expired on ... Renew it on the connection.*"
msgstr "*The bank consent expired on ... Renew it on the connection.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:294
msgid "Same as above; Odoo stopped calling the bank when the consent ended."
msgstr ""
"La fel ca mai sus; Odoo a încetat să apeleze banca atunci când "
"consimțământul s-a încheiat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:295
msgid "*The bank refused the request: daily access limit reached ...*"
msgstr "*The bank refused the request: daily access limit reached ...*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:296
msgid "Wait for the next day, or click :guilabel:`Sync now`."
msgstr ""
"Așteptați ziua următoare sau faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Sincronizează acum`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:297
msgid "*Enable Banking is not reachable: ...*"
msgstr "*Enable Banking is not reachable: ...*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:298
msgid ""
"A network problem or a temporary outage of the service. The next scheduled "
"run tries again."
msgstr ""
"O problemă de rețea sau o întrerupere temporară a serviciului. Următoarea "
"rulare programată încearcă din nou."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:299
msgid "*Enable Banking error <status> <code>: ...*"
msgstr "*Enable Banking error <status> <code>: ...*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:300
msgid ""
"The answer of Enable Banking, unchanged. A 4xx status usually points to the "
"application (for instance an unknown redirect URL or an environment "
"mismatch), a 5xx status to a temporary problem at Enable Banking or the bank."
msgstr ""
"Răspunsul Enable Banking, nemodificat. Un status 4xx indică de obicei "
"aplicația (de exemplu un redirect URL necunoscut sau o nepotrivire de "
"mediu), iar un status 5xx o problemă temporară la Enable Banking sau la "
"bancă."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:303
msgid "The bank returns you to Odoo with *Bank authorization failed*"
msgstr "Banca vă returnează în Odoo cu *Bank authorization failed*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:304
msgid ""
"The bank or Enable Banking refused the consent; the reason is displayed. Fix "
"it and click :guilabel:`Connect to bank` again. If the redirect URL is "
"refused, compare it with the one registered in the Control Panel."
msgstr ""
"Banca sau Enable Banking a refuzat consimțământul; motivul este afișat. "
"Remediați-l și faceți clic din nou pe :guilabel:`Connect to bank`. Dacă "
"redirect URL-ul este refuzat, comparați-l cu cel înregistrat în Control "
"Panel."

