msgstr ""
"Creați contul bancar al companiei dumneavoastră și setați-l pe jurnalul "
"bancar (:menuselection:`Contabilitate --> Configurare --> "
"Jurnale`, :guilabel:`Număr cont`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/statement_import.rst:146
msgid ""
"*The bank account with number ... exists in Odoo but it is not set on any "
"bank journal.*"
msgstr ""
"*The bank account with number ... exists in Odoo but it is not set on any "
"bank journal.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/statement_import.rst:147
