"*The bank statement file uses currency '...' but there is no such currency "
"in Odoo.*"
msgstr ""
"*The bank statement file uses currency '...' but there is no such currency "
"in Odoo.*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/statement_import.rst:154
