#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:132
msgid ""
"To verify the contact, enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and "
"click :guilabel:`Verify`. Its :guilabel:`Peppol status` is marked "
"as :guilabel:`Valid` if the contact is found on the Peppol network."
msgstr ""
