"mode>` și faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Verifică`. :guilabel:`Statutul Peppol` "
"al acestuia este marcat ca :guilabel:`Valid` dacă contactul este găsit în "
"rețeaua Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:145
msgid ""
"While Odoo prefills the endpoint number based on the information available "
"for a contact, verifying these details with the contact is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Deși Odoo precompletează numărul de endpoint pe baza informațiilor "
"disponibile pentru un contact, se recomandă verificarea acestor detalii cu "
"contactul."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:151
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/sii.rst:93
msgid "Send invoices"
msgstr "Trimite facturi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:153
msgid ""
"Posted invoices to be sent via Peppol are marked as :guilabel:`Ready to "
"send` in the invoice's :guilabel:`Peppol status` field."
msgstr ""
"Facturile postate care urmează să fie trimise prin Peppol sunt marcate "
