"Iată cum Odoo asigură conformitatea:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ireland.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the XML and :abbr:`UBL (Universal "
