#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:5
msgid "Odoo electronic invoicing in Italy"
msgstr "Facturarea electronică Odoo în Italia"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is your trusted partner for safe, efficient, and legally "
"compliant e-invoicing solutions tailored to Italy's regulatory standards."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Invoicing este partenerul dumneavoastră de încredere pentru soluții de "
"facturare electronică sigure, eficiente și conforme legal, adaptate "
"standardelor de reglementare ale Italiei."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:11
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Italy"
msgstr "Cadrul legal pentru facturarea electronică în Italia"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:13
msgid ""
"Italy has one of the most advanced e-invoicing frameworks in Europe, "
"governed by the `Italian budget law <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2022/12/29/22G00211/sg>`_ and regulations issued by the Agenzia delle "
"Entrate. Since 2019, e-invoicing is mandatory for B2B, B2C, and :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` transactions. All e-invoices must be submitted "
"through the :abbr:`Sdi (Sistema di Interscambio)`, the Italian government's "
"centralized exchange system. The format for e-invoices is FatturaPA, a "
"structured XML format specifically designed for compliance with Italian "
"regulations. As part of its compliance with `EU Directive 2014/55/EU "
"<https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, "
"Italy also supports Peppol standards for cross-border e-invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Italia are unul dintre cele mai avansate cadre de facturare electronică din "
"Europa, guvernat de `legea bugetară italiană <https://"
"www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/2022/12/29/22G00211/sg>`_ și reglementările "
"emise de Agenzia delle Entrate. Din 2019, facturarea electronică este "
"obligatorie pentru tranzacțiile B2B, B2C și :abbr:`B2G (business-to-"
"government)`. Toate facturile electronice trebuie să fie transmise "
"prin :abbr:`Sdi (Sistema di Interscambio)`, sistemul centralizat de schimb "
"al guvernului italian. Formatul pentru facturile electronice este FatturaPA, "
"un format XML structurat conceput special pentru conformitatea cu "
"reglementările italiene. Ca parte a conformității sale cu `Directiva UE "
"2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?"
"uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, Italia suportă și standardele Peppol pentru "
"facturarea electronică transfrontalieră."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:23
msgid "Compliance with Italian e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr "Conformitatea cu reglementările de facturare electronică italiene"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:25
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is fully equipped to meet Italy's e-invoicing requirements. "
