"the :doc:`printable financial reports <reporting/pdf_reports>` (*Accounting "
"Financial Reports*, *Cash Book / Day Book / Bank Book* and the XLSX export), "
"which produce a fixed PDF or Excel document from a wizard, for filing and "
"for the auditor;"
msgstr ""
":doc:`rapoartele financiare tipăribile <reporting/pdf_reports>` (*Accounting "
"Financial Reports*, *Cash Book / Day Book / Bank Book* și exportul XLSX), "
"care produc un document PDF sau Excel fix dintr-un expert, pentru depunere "
"și pentru auditor;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:15
