#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:186
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Deferred Expense` and :guilabel:`Deferred Revenue` reports "
"show, period by period, the amounts that have been spread over time from "
"bills and invoices."
msgstr ""
"Rapoartele :guilabel:`Cheltuială amânată` și :guilabel:`Venit amânat` "
"afișează, perioadă cu perioadă, sumele care au fost repartizate în timp din "
"facturi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:190
