msgid ":guilabel:`Approve` moves it to :guilabel:`Validated`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Aprobă` îl mută în starea :guilabel:`Validat`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:114
msgid ":guilabel:`Done` closes the budget at the end of its period."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Efectuat` închide bugetul la sfârșitul perioadei sale."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cancel Budget` is available while the budget is confirmed or "
"validated, and :guilabel:`Reset to Draft` brings a cancelled budget back for "
"editing."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Anulează bugetul` este disponibil cât timp bugetul este confirmat "
"sau validat, iar :guilabel:`Resetează la ciornă` readuce un buget anulat "
"pentru editare."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:122
msgid "Budgets Analysis"
msgstr "Analiza bugetelor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:124
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Management --> Budgets "
"Analysis` opens all budget lines of all budgets in one place, with list, "
"pivot and graph views. Cancelled budgets are excluded by default and the "
"lines are grouped by budget. Use it to compare several budgets, to analyze "
"the achievement per analytic account, or to build a pivot of planned versus "
"practical amounts."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Contabilitate --> Raportare --> Management --> Analiza "
"bugetelor` deschide într-un singur loc toate liniile de buget ale tuturor "
"bugetelor, cu vizualizări listă, pivot și grafic. Bugetele anulate sunt "
"excluse implicit, iar liniile sunt grupate pe buget. Utilizați-o pentru a "
"compara mai multe bugete, pentru a analiza realizarea pe cont analitic sau "
"pentru a construi un pivot al sumelor planificate față de cele practice."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:130
msgid ""
"The planned amounts can also be displayed next to the actuals in "
