#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:56
msgid ""
"Within the Australian localization, tax names encompass the tax rate as an "
"integral part of their naming convention. Despite the high number "
"of :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>` configured in Odoo, their rates are "
"often similar (0% or 10%)."
msgstr ""
"În cadrul localizării australiene, numele taxelor cuprind rata taxei ca "
"parte integrantă a convenției lor de denumire. În ciuda numărului mare "
"de :doc:`taxe <../accounting/taxes>` configurate în Odoo, ratele acestora "
"sunt adesea similare (0% sau 10%)."

