#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:137
msgid ""
"Businesses from certain industries need to report payments made to "
"subcontractors from relevant services during the financial year (Taxable "
"Payments Annual Report, TPAR). Two variants of the main purchase taxes are "
"available in Odoo to keep these payments separate, but they are inactive by "
"default. The TPAR itself is not generated by Odoo; the amounts can be "
"extracted from the tax report or the general ledger by tax."
msgstr ""
"Companiile din anumite industrii trebuie să raporteze plățile efectuate "
"către subcontractori pentru servicii relevante în timpul anului financiar "
"(Taxable Payments Annual Report, TPAR). În Odoo sunt disponibile două "
"variante ale principalelor taxe de achiziție pentru a menține aceste plăți "
"separate, dar sunt inactive implicit. TPAR în sine nu este generat de Odoo; "
"sumele pot fi extrase din raportul de taxe sau din cartea mare, pe taxe."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:145
