#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:64
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Enter the company's NIT."
msgstr ":guilabel:`CIF`: introduceți NIT-ul companiei."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:67
msgid "Multi-currency"
msgstr "Valute Multiple"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:69
msgid ""
"The official currency exchange rate in Guatemala is provided by the Bank of "
"Guatemala. Currency rates can be updated automatically with the *eYssen "
"currency rate updater* module (see :ref:`multi-currency/config-rates-auto`); "
"the Bank of Guatemala is not among its providers, so the rates come from a "
"generic provider (e.g., xe.com) or must be entered manually."
msgstr ""
"Cursul oficial de schimb valutar din Guatemala este furnizat de Banca "
"Guatemalei. Cursurile valutare pot fi actualizate automat cu modulul *eYssen "
"currency rate updater* (consultați :ref:`multi-currency/config-rates-auto`); "
"Banca Guatemalei nu se numără printre furnizorii săi, astfel încât cursurile "
"provin de la un furnizor generic (de exemplu, xe.com) sau trebuie introduse "
"manual."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:75
msgid ":doc:`Multi-currencies <../accounting/get_started/multi_currency>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Multimonedă <../accounting/get_started/multi_currency>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:83
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"is installed by default as part of the set of data included in the "
"localization module, the accounts are mapped automatically in taxes, default "
"accounts payable, and default accounts receivable."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Planul de conturi <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` este "
"instalat în mod implicit ca parte a setului de date incluse în modulul de "
"localizare, conturile sunt mapate automat în taxe, conturile implicit de "
"furnizori și conturile implicit de clienți."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:87
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:85
msgid "Accounts can be added or deleted according to the company's needs."
msgstr "Conturile pot fi adăugate sau șterse conform nevoilor companiei."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:92
msgid "The following fields should be completed on contact forms:"
msgstr "Următoarele câmpuri trebuie completate în formularele de contact:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`: the contact's NIT (or CUI for individuals)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`CIF`: NIT-ul contactului (sau CUI pentru persoane fizice)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:102
msgid ""
"As part of the Guatemala localization module, taxes are automatically "
"created with their configuration and related financial accounts: the 12 % "
"VAT on sales and purchases, and the ISR (5 %) and VAT (12 %) withholding "
"taxes."
msgstr ""
"Ca parte a modulului de localizare Guatemala, taxele sunt create automat cu "
"configurația lor și cu conturile financiare aferente: TVA de 12 % la vânzări "
"și achiziții, precum și taxele de reținere ISR (5 %) și TVA (12 %)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hong_kong.rst:3
msgid "Hong Kong"
msgstr "Hong Kong"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hong_kong.rst:8
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get the latest "
"features of the Hong Kong localization:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instalați <general/install>` următoarele module pentru a obține cele "
"mai recente caracteristici ale localizării din Hong Kong:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hong_kong.rst:17
msgid ":guilabel:`Hong Kong - Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Hong Kong - Contabilitate`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hong_kong.rst:18
