#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`VAT Number`: the Hungarian tax number in the `12345678-1-12` "
"format;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cod TVA`: codul fiscal maghiar în formatul `12345678-1-12`;"

