msgstr ":guilabel:`ID Companie`: numărul de înregistrare al companiei."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:165
msgid ""
"At least one bank account of the company must be recorded: a customer "
"invoice cannot be confirmed without a :guilabel:`Recipient Bank`. When the "
"currency of an invoice or quotation changes, the first company bank account "
"in that currency is selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Trebuie înregistrat cel puțin un cont bancar al companiei: o factură client "
"nu poate fi confirmată fără :guilabel:`Bancă Destinatar`. Când moneda unei "
"facturi sau a unei oferte se schimbă, primul cont bancar al companiei în "
"acea monedă este selectat automat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:182
msgid ""
"On the contact form of companies located in Hungary, the standard *Tax ID* "
"field is replaced by:"
msgstr ""
"Pe formularul de contact al companiilor situate în Ungaria, câmpul standard "
"*CIF* este înlocuit cu:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:184
msgid ""
":guilabel:`VAT Number`: the Hungarian tax number (`12345678-1-23`). The "
"format and the check digit are verified; an invalid number is marked with a "
"red ✕ and a warning."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cod TVA`: codul fiscal maghiar (`12345678-1-23`). Formatul și "
"cifra de control sunt verificate; un număr invalid este marcat cu un ✕ roșu "
"și un avertisment."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Group VAT Number`: filled in automatically for members of a VAT "
"group. If NAV reports that the partner is a group member but the full group "
"number is not known, the warning *The Partner is a Group VAT payer! The "
