"ceea ce poate suprascrie interogarea."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:211
msgid ""
"If another contact without a parent company already uses the same tax "
"number, the banner *Another partner is already registered with this tax "
"number!* is shown with a :guilabel:`View the other partner` link."
msgstr ""
"Dacă un alt contact fără companie părinte utilizează deja același cod "
