"this tax number!* cu un link :guilabel:`Vezi celălalt partener`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:224
msgid ""
"The Hungarian tax number is shared with the child contacts of a company. On "
"an *Invoice Address* contact, :guilabel:`Use as Company` (enabled by "
"default) makes the invoice and the NAV data report use the tax number of the "
