msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Acord de factură electronică`: :ref:`formatul facturii "
"<localizations/hungary/invoice-format>` pentru facturile clientului este "
"implicit *Electronic*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:242
msgid "Taxes, tax groups and fiscal positions"
msgstr "Taxe, grupuri de taxe și poziții fiscale"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:245
msgid "Tax groups"
msgstr "Grupuri de taxe"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:247
msgid ""
"The VAT data of the NAV report is taken from the **tax group** of the tax "
"used on the invoice line. Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Tax Groups` (the menu is visible without :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>` in Hungarian databases) and check the :guilabel:`NAV` section of each "
"group:"
msgstr ""
"Datele de TVA din raportul NAV sunt preluate din **grupul de taxe** al taxei "
"utilizate pe linia facturii. Accesați :menuselection:`Contabilitate --> "
"Configurare --> Grupuri taxă` (meniul este vizibil fără :ref:`modul "
"dezvoltator <developer-mode>` în bazele de date maghiare) și verificați "
"secțiunea :guilabel:`NAV` a fiecărui grup:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount %`: the VAT rate of the group, computed from its Hungarian "
"taxes (0 for reverse-charge, exempt and out-of-scope groups);"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sumă %`: cota de TVA a grupului, calculată din taxele sale "
"maghiare (0 pentru grupurile cu taxare inversă, scutite și în afara sferei "
"de aplicare);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:254
msgid ":guilabel:`Reversed`: domestic reverse charge (*fordított adózás*);"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Inversat`: taxare inversă internă (*fordított adózás*);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Az adómentesség jelölés kódja` (VAT exemption code): `AAM`, "
"`TAM`, `KBAET`, `KBAUK`, `EAM`, `NAM` or `UNKNOWN`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Az adómentesség jelölés kódja` (codul de scutire de TVA): `AAM`, "
"`TAM`, `KBAET`, `KBAUK`, `EAM`, `NAM` sau `UNKNOWN`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:257
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Az Áfa tv. hatályán kívüliség kódja` (out of the scope of the VAT "
"Act): `ATK`, `EUFAD37`, `EUFADE`, `EUE`, `HO` or `UNKNOWN`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Az Áfa tv. hatályán kívüliség kódja` (în afara sferei de aplicare "
"a Legii TVA): `ATK`, `EUFAD37`, `EUFADE`, `EUE`, `HO` sau `UNKNOWN`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:259
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Adóalap és felszámított adó eltérésének kódja` (VAT amount "
"mismatch): `REFUNDABLE_VAT` or `NONREFUNDABLE_VAT`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Adóalap és felszámított adó eltérésének kódja` (diferență între "
"baza de impozitare și taxa calculată): `REFUNDABLE_VAT` sau "
"`NONREFUNDABLE_VAT`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:261
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Különbözet szerinti jogcímek` (margin scheme): `TRAVEL_AGENCY`, "
"`SECOND_HAND`, `ARTWORK` or `ANTIQUES`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Különbözet szerinti jogcímek` (regimul marjei): `TRAVEL_AGENCY`, "
"`SECOND_HAND`, `ARTWORK` sau `ANTIQUES`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:263
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Legal Notes`: the reason text sent to NAV for exempt and out-of-"
"scope items."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Note legale`: textul motivului transmis către NAV pentru "
"elementele scutite și cele din afara sferei de aplicare."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:265
msgid ""
"Only one of the four code fields can be set on a group. The labels of these "
"fields are displayed in Hungarian in the current module version."
msgstr ""
"Pe un grup poate fi setat un singur câmp dintre cele patru câmpuri de cod. "
"Etichetele acestor câmpuri sunt afișate în limba maghiară în versiunea "
"curentă a modulului."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:269
msgid ""
"Every product line of a customer invoice must carry **exactly one** tax, and "
"the rate of the tax must equal the :guilabel:`Amount %` of its tax group; "
"otherwise the invoice cannot be confirmed. Create one tax group per VAT rate."
msgstr ""
"Fiecare linie de produs a unei facturi client trebuie să conțină **exact o** "
"taxă, iar cota taxei trebuie să fie egală cu :guilabel:`Sumă %` a grupului "
"său de taxe; în caz contrar, factura nu poate fi confirmată. Creați câte un "
"grup de taxe pentru fiecare cotă de TVA."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:284
msgid ""
"The tax form (:menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`) "
"contains three additional options:"
msgstr ""
"Formularul taxei (:menuselection:`Contabilitate --> Configurare --> Taxe`) "
"conține trei opțiuni suplimentare:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`VTSZ is Required`: an invoice line with this tax can only be "
"confirmed if a :ref:`customs tariff number (VTSZ) <localizations/hungary/"
"products>` is set on the product (typically for domestic reverse-charge "
"goods);"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`VTSZ este obligatoriu`: o linie de factură cu această taxă poate "
"fi confirmată numai dacă un :ref:`număr din tariful vamal (VTSZ) "
"<localizations/hungary/products>` este setat pe produs (de obicei pentru "
"bunurile cu taxare inversă internă);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:290
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Nem készíthető Gyűjtőszámla ezzel az áfa kulccsal` (sales taxes): "
"the tax cannot be used on :ref:`aggregate invoices <localizations/hungary/"
"aggregate>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nem készíthető Gyűjtőszámla ezzel az áfa kulccsal` (taxe de "
"vânzare): taxa nu poate fi utilizată pe :ref:`facturi agregate "
"<localizations/hungary/aggregate>`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:292
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Alap % Áfa bevallásban` (purchase taxes, default `100`): the "
"percentage of the tax base taken into account in the :doc:`VAT return "
"<hungary/vat_return>` and in the VAT analytics, for partially deductible VAT."
msgstr ""
