msgstr ":guilabel:`Kenya - Accounting`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:21
msgid "`l10n_ke`"
msgstr "`l10n_ke`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:22
msgid ""
"Default :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`: "
"chart of accounts, taxes with their KRA item codes, tax grids, and "
"withholding certificate fields on vendor bills."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Pachet implicit de localizare fiscală <fiscal_localizations/"
"packages>`: plan de conturi, taxe cu codurile lor de articol KRA, grile "
"fiscale și câmpuri pentru certificatul de reținere la sursă pe facturile "
