#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:224
msgid ""
":doc:`Stripe Payment Provider documentation <../../../applications/finance/"
"payment_providers/stripe>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Documentația furnizorului de plăți Stripe <../../../applications/"
"finance/payment_providers/stripe>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:212
msgid "Point of Sale terminals"
msgstr "Terminale Point of Sale"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:214
msgid ""
"To have a direct connection between Odoo and a PoS terminal, a :doc:`Stripe "
"terminal <../../../applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>` is needed. Odoo supports the **EFTPOS** payment solution."
msgstr ""
"Pentru a avea o conexiune directă între Odoo și un terminal PoS, este "
"necesar un :doc:`terminal Stripe <../../../applications/sales/point_of_sale/"
"payment_methods/terminals/stripe>`. Odoo acceptă soluția de plată **EFTPOS**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:219
msgid ""
"A Stripe payment terminal is not needed to use Odoo as the main POS system. "
"The only drawback of not using Stripe is that cashiers must manually enter "
"the final payment amount on the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Un terminal de plată Stripe nu este necesar pentru a folosi Odoo ca sistem "
"POS principal. Singurul dezavantaj al nefolosirii Stripe este că casierii "
"trebuie să introducă manual suma finală de plată pe terminal."

