msgstr "Eroare"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:281
msgid ""
"The tax identification number of the company is missing or its control digit "
"is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Codul de identificare fiscală al companiei lipsește sau cifra sa de control "
"este invalidă."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:282
msgid "`DECLARANT`"
msgstr "`DECLARANT`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:284
msgid "The last name, first name or position of the declarant is missing."
msgstr "Numele, prenumele sau funcția declarantului lipsesc."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:285
msgid "`PARTNER_ID`"
msgstr "`PARTNER_ID`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:287
msgid ""
"A partner used in the period has no usable identifier, or its identifier is "
"not valid."
msgstr ""
"Un partener utilizat în perioadă nu are un identificator utilizabil sau "
"identificatorul său nu este valid."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:288
msgid "`ACCOUNT_UNMAPPED`, `ACCOUNT_CODE`, `ACCOUNT_DUPLICATE`"
msgstr "`ACCOUNT_UNMAPPED`, `ACCOUNT_CODE`, `ACCOUNT_DUPLICATE`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:290
msgid ""
"An account does not match any account of the ANAF chart, has no numeric SAF-"
"T account ID, or the same ID is used by two accounts."
msgstr ""
"Un cont nu corespunde niciunui cont din planul ANAF, nu are un ID de cont "
"SAF-T numeric sau același ID este utilizat de două conturi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:292
msgid "`TAX_UNMAPPED`"
msgstr "`TAX_UNMAPPED`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:294
msgid "A tax used in the period has no SAF-T tax code."
msgstr "O taxă utilizată în perioadă nu are cod de taxă SAF-T."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:295
msgid "`TRIAL_BALANCE`, `GLE_BALANCE`"
msgstr "`TRIAL_BALANCE`, `GLE_BALANCE`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:297
msgid ""
"The opening and closing balances, or the general ledger entries, do not "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Soldurile inițiale și finale sau înregistrările din cartea mare nu sunt "
"echilibrate."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:298
msgid "`PARTNER_CITY`"
msgstr "`PARTNER_CITY`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:299
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:302
