msgid ""
"You can reach the **Chart of Accounts** by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting: Chart of "
"Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Puteți ajunge la **Planul de conturi** "
"accesând :menuselection:`Contabilitate --> Configurare --> Contabilitate: "
