"www.paypal.com/webapps/mpp/country-worldwide>`_, doar `o selecție de valute "
"sunt acceptate <https://developer.paypal.com/docs/reports/reference/paypal-"
"supported-currencies>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paypal.rst:16
